# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/frame/fixtures/missing
# A photo file gone from the shelf is skipped, and the page asks for a push.
wait-for No photograph can be opened
expect 2 photos could not be read. Push the album again from your computer.
expect Check for photos
expect-missing No photo on this shelf can be read
clean
shot missing
# Checking before anything is pushed keeps the same page.
tap Check for photos
wait-idle
wait-for No photograph can be opened
# The push the page asks for has to be able to repair the shelf, and the
# button on the page is enough to find it.
companion frame push scripts/fixtures/frame/lighthouse.jpg --album Coast --replace --sim
tap Check for photos
wait-for-id next
wait-idle
expect-missing No photograph can be opened
clean
shot missing-repaired
